{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15730","headline":"送王使君赴太原拜节度副使 · 司空曙","name":"送王使君赴太原拜节度副使","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新从刘太尉，结束向幷州。\n络脑青丝骑，盘囊锦带钩。\n出关逢将校，下岭拥戈矛。\n匣闭黄云冷，山传画角秋。\n劒锋将破虏，函道罢登楼。\n岂作书生老，当封万户侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15730.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15730","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}